```console
$ scherzo-cloud project runner-pool set --help
Assign or replace a project's runner pool

Usage: scherzo-cloud project runner-pool set [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <PROJECT> <POOL>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <PROJECT>       Exact project ID
  <POOL>          Exact runner pool ID

Options:
      --json                 Print the project result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
